# Custom traditions: finite reviewed choices, not an unrestricted numerical bonus editor.
# https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions (Ultimate)
Custom Casting Tradition	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Tradition	TYPE:CustomCastingTradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,1	DEFINE:SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|0	DEFINE:SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|0	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Drawback|5	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_SPELL_POINTS|if(SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS-2*SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS>=5,SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS,if(SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS-2*SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS>=4,1+floor(2*SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS/3),if(SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS-2*SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS>=3,floor((SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS+1)/2),if(SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS-2*SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS>=2,1+floor(SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS/3),if(SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS-2*SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS>=1,1+floor(SPHERES_SPELL_POOL_LEVELS/6),0)))))	DESC:Choose your INT/WIS/CHA casting ability in Spheres Casting Ability. Up to five drawback points; each boon consumes two; remaining points increase spell pool per the Ultimate chart. GM approves the tradition. Drawback restrictions and boon actions are sheet rules, not automatically enforced.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/casting-traditions
Tradition - Verbal Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Magic requires clear audible speech; silence and inability to speak prevent casting. One drawback point.
Tradition - Somatic Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Magic requires gestures. One drawback point; a second selection of Somatic Casting requires GM review and is not represented here.
Tradition - Focus Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Requires a designated focus to cast; record the focus in character notes. One drawback point.
Tradition - Magical Signs	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Your magic has obvious sensory manifestations. One drawback point.
Tradition - Prepared Caster	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Prepare sphere effects as required by Prepared Caster. One drawback point; track preparations manually.
Tradition - Easy Focus	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Boon	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|1	DESC:Maintain concentration as a move action; action economy is resolved at the table. Costs two general drawback points.
Tradition - Fortified Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Boon	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Drawback,Tradition - Draining Casting	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|1	DESC:Use Constitution as your casting ability modifier if higher than your usual casting ability modifier. Requires Draining Casting; modifier substitution is not automatic. Costs two drawback points.
Tradition - Metamagic Expert	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Boon	COST:2	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_BOONS|1	DESC:+1 competence bonus to caster level when augmenting sphere abilities with a metamagic feat; situational. Costs two drawback points.
Tradition - Draining Casting	CATEGORY:Custom Casting Drawback	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Custom Casting Tradition,Custom Casting Tradition	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Casting Boon|1	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_TRADITION_DRAWBACKS|1	DESC:Draining Casting drawback; record and adjudicate nonlethal damage according to the source. One drawback point.
# https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions (Ultimate custom tradition guidelines)
Custom Martial Tradition	CATEGORY:Conscript Martial Tradition	TYPE:CustomMartialTradition	PREVARGTEQ:SPHERES_CONSCRIPT_LEVEL,1	ABILITY:Spheres Combat Talent|AUTOMATIC|Equipment Sphere	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Martial Equipment|1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Martial Sphere|1	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Custom Martial Theme|1	DESC:With GM approval choose two Equipment talents (one from Equipment Sphere's existing free grant and one from Custom Martial Equipment), one non-Equipment base sphere, and one thematic combat talent/base sphere. No choices spend Conscript combat talents. Source exceptions and starting proficiency trades remain manual.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/martial-traditions